Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs28\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(112.8,67.2)}It won't stop... datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a total disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going, Mogura?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The bidet shower won't stop washing my rear end,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's been going on for about an hour now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mogura-ojisan, those things have sensors, \Nso if you lift your hips up, it's supposed to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, I'll try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No good, \NI can't lift up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mogura, you gotta summon some courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about courage, \NI just don't know *{\i1}how{\i0}* to lift up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you just move a bit—\NLook!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.28,0:00:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say "look"!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsun-tsun, \Nis there a specific side—right or left—I should lift first?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, just do both at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A little hop is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't hurry, \Nit's gonna pierce right through me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pierce through?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mogura, there's something I want to ask you, \Nis that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it quick, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When aliens come to Earth, \Nthey always say "{\i1}We are aliens{\i0}," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.03,0:00:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(185.6,27.733)}{\fnFredoka\b1\fs25\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(112.8,67.2)}Note: We are aliens
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do they do when they come all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's just one person, \Nit's "I", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I am an alien."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really picture that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were "I", the sentence ending would be "-nari", \Nwouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.94,0:01:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you say "wouldn't it"-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am an alien, nari{\i0}."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.53,0:01:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I hate to interrupt when you guys are having fun, \Nbut could you stop talking about unrelated stuff-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.77,0:01:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? What's wrong, \Ndid it pierce through?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.61,0:01:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, should I go to the backroom \Nand get some band-aids?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.13,0:01:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll head over to the drink bar.
